    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Hexagon Navigation Lite allows you to easily build modern, responsive hexagon grid menus directly in the WordPress block editor. Perfect for portfolios, landing pages, and creative navigation layouts.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<h4>From your WordPress dashboard</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Visit <strong>Plugins &gt; Add New</strong>.</li>\n<li>Search for <strong>Hexagon Navigation Lite</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Install Now</strong> and then <strong>Activate</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Manual Installation</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the plugin ZIP file and unzip it.</li>\n<li>Upload the <code>hexagon-navigation-lite</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the <strong>Plugins</strong> menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create stunning honeycomb bento-style navigation menus with a custom Gutenberg block. Impress your visitors with unique geometric layouts!",
    "description": "<p>Hexagon Navigation Lite allows you to easily build modern, responsive hexagon grid menus directly in the WordPress block editor. Perfect for portfolios, landing pages, and creative navigation layouts.</p>\n",
